    "Changes will apply to videos moved to trash in the future. The expiration date of videos currently in trash will not change. If 'Do Not Auto-Delete' is selected, files will continue to consume device storage until manually deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changes will apply to videos moved to trash in the future. The expiration date of videos currently in trash will not change. If 'Do Not Auto-Delete' is selected, files will continue to consume device storage until manually deleted."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定を変更すると、今後ゴミ箱に移動した動画から適用されます。既にゴミ箱にある動画の期限は変更されません。「自動削除しない」を選択した場合、手動で削除するまで端末の容量を消費し続けます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
